#HELPS
1 ARVEL PLANTATION~
Arvel Plantation is a wealthy Hlaalu estate located between Pelagiad and Suran
where corkbulb fields sustain the wealth and influence of its noble household.
Fine clothing and guarded comforts reveal the success enjoyed within the manor
as enslaved workers labor across the surrounding farmland.~
